    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><msqrt><mi>A</mi></msqrt></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mi>A</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, (<math><mi>C</mi></math> is a constant of integration), then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
